    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Rpld §680-f, Gen Muni L",
    "lawSection": "General Municipal Law",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S4047\n\nTITLE OF BILL:\nAn act\nto repeal section 680-f of the general municipal law relating to the\nvillage of Westbury Community Development Agency\n\nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\nTo dissolve Westbury Community\nAgency, which is no longer needed as the Nassau County Urban\nConsortium has undertaken the agency's responsibilities.\n\nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\nSection 1. Repeals section 680-f of\nthe general municipal law.\nSection 2. This act shall take effect immediately.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:\nThe Westbury Community Development Agency has been\ninactive ever since the Village of Westbury has participated in the\nNassau County Community Development Block Grant Program under the\nNassau County Urban Consortium. The Agency is no longer necessary due\nto the shift in responsibilities to the Nassau County Urban Consortium.\n\nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\nNew Bill.\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\nNone.\n\nEFFECTIVE ATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n\n",
